{"id": "EUVD-2026-98943", "enisaUuid": "7749d9cc-dfa7-304a-ada1-5d375b1a6ba7", "description": "JetLinks Community through 2.10.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows users with only query access to enable or disable any alarm configuration. Because the AlarmConfigController _enable and _disable endpoints lack the save action annotation, attackers can toggle alarms by id to silence alerts for monitored devices.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:11", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:53:11", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/jetlinks-community-transparent-codec-save-authz-bypass", "https://github.com/jetlinks/jetlinks-community/blob/60ecc9f65d96acfd38da8daecdb0062fc72034f3/jetlinks-manager/rule-engine-manager/src/main/java/org/jetlinks/community/rule/engine/web/AlarmConfigController.java#L63-L73", "https://github.com/hs-web/hsweb-framework/blob/5.0.1/hsweb-authorization/hsweb-authorization-api/src/main/java/org/hswebframework/web/authorization/Authentication.java#L206-L218", "https://github.com/jetlinks/jetlinks-community", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jetlinks-community-through-2.10.0-missing-authorization-via-alarm-enable-disable-endpoints"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110110", "GHSA-p649-73fc-3wmq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "433a4ab8-4efe-3f80-8a0d-dee60bede16c", "product": {"name": "JetLinks Community", "vendor": {"name": "jetlinks"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.10.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b76af0f3-c82c-348f-b533-0d7393821c87", "vendor": {"name": "jetlinks"}}], "isExploited": false}